      "writtenOn": "2019-05-15T08:26:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC you are trying to group uids with the same permission bits.\nAnd send them to netd by groups.\nHowever it is all hardcoded.\nThat might make things harder to maintain over time.\n\nIs it better if we just group them by hash map or sparce array?\ne.g.\nHashMap\u003cInteger, ArrayList\u003cInteger\u003e\u003e buckets\nfor(item in netdPermissionsAppIds)\n  permission \u003d item.value\n  uid \u003d item.key\n  buckets.get(permission).add(uid);\nfor(item in buckets)\n  mNetd.trafficSetNetPermForUids(item.key, convertToIntArray(item.value))",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 595,
        "startChar": 9,
        "endLine": 595,
        "endChar": 37
      },
      "revId": "88e9430bb6b7469c3fa3904f844d8cf01e7dc755",
